{"ticker":"MCK","updated":"2026-10-30T22:58:23Z","profile":{"longName":"McKesson Corporation","shortName":"McKesson Corporation","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Medical Distribution","country":"United States","website":"https://www.mckesson.com","fullTimeEmployees":41600,"marketCap":115958439936,"trailingPE":26.657196,"forwardPE":19.643723,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":0.282149,"pegRatio":1.84,"targetMeanPrice":1009.6429,"targetHighPrice":1200.0,"targetLowPrice":845.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":14,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.077,"earningsGrowth":-0.176,"grossMargins":0.03633,"operatingMargins":0.01348,"profitMargins":0.01117,"totalRevenue":410983006208,"beta":0.298,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":1030.27,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":723.68,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.38},"summary":"McKesson Corporation provides healthcare services in the United States and internationally. It operates through four segments: North American Pharmaceutical, Oncology & Multispecialty, Prescription Technology Solutions, and Medical-Surgical Solutions. The company distributes branded, generic, specialty, biosimilar and over-the-counter pharmaceutical drugs, and other healthcare-related products; delivers products to retail pharmacies, hospitals, long-term care centers, clinics, and institutions; and provides logistics and distribution services for manufacturers. It also provides consulting, outsourcing, technological, and other services, as well as sells financial, operational, and clinical solutions to pharmacies; gene therapy with InspiroGene, practice consulting, and vaccine distribution services; and technology solutions, as well as research, insights, technologies, and services to improve cancer and specialty care. In addition, the company helps in solving medication access, affordability, and adherence challenges for patients by working across healthcare to connect patients, pharmacies, providers, pharmacy benefit managers, health plans, and biopharma companies. Further, it offers technology services, which includes electronic prior authorization, prescription price transparency, benefit insight, dispensing support services, patient enrollment, third-party logistics, and w","summary_zh":"麥克森公司在美國和國際上提供醫療保健服務。它透過四個部門運作：北美製藥部門、腫瘤學和多專業部門、處方技術解決方案部門和醫療外科解決方案部門。該公司分銷品牌藥品、仿製藥、特種藥品、生物相似藥和非處方藥品以及其他醫療保健相關產品；向零售藥房、醫院、長期護理中心、診所和機構提供產品；並為製造商提供物流配送服務。它還提供諮詢、外包、技術和其他服務，並向藥房銷售財務、營運和臨床解決方案； InspiroGene 基因治療、實踐諮詢和疫苗分銷服務；和技術解決方案，以及改善癌症和專業護理的研究、見解、技術和服務。此外，該公司還透過跨醫療保健領域的工作，將患者、藥房、提供者、藥品福利管理者、健康計劃和生物製藥公司聯繫起來，幫助解決患者的藥物取得、負擔能力和依從性挑戰。此外，它還提供技術服務，包括電子事先授權、處方價格透明度、效益洞察、配藥支援服務、病患登記、第三方物流和w","sector_zh":"衛生保健","industry_zh":"醫療配送","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":687.33,"h":696.47,"l":684.51,"c":691.62,"v":756000},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":695.07,"h":695.07,"l":685.47,"c":690.84,"v":420200},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":690.57,"h":696.75,"l":688.37,"c":691.45,"v":731600},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":689.8,"h":690.71,"l":682.35,"c":687.4,"v":472800},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":688.0,"h":697.56,"l":683.38,"c":696.98,"v":592200},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":696.9,"h":707.18,"l":692.86,"c":705.55,"v":679800},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":701.04,"h":709.21,"l":698.77,"c":706.25,"v":504700},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":707.16,"h":727.31,"l":706.0,"c":719.8,"v":744900},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":717.6,"h":724.0,"l":710.58,"c":711.42,"v":522400},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":711.61,"h":715.29,"l":700.98,"c":702.88,"v":630800},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":705.1,"h":707.7,"l":691.63,"c":693.45,"v":617500},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":696.2,"h":700.0,"l":691.34,"c":692.24,"v":434100},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":690.98,"h":697.98,"l":688.0,"c":690.13,"v":518700},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":690.67,"h":699.38,"l":690.67,"c":698.31,"v":1445600},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":696.2,"h":700.79,"l":687.68,"c":697.0,"v":583800},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":714.0,"h":748.75,"l":714.0,"c":741.31,"v":1141100},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":750.0,"h":770.0,"l":745.66,"c":760.58,"v":916700},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":762.6,"h":763.01,"l":715.31,"c":736.52,"v":1536700},{